(7447583, 1178223, 150277, '<td valign="top">Love the typewriter, and love the concept for the challenge.  I didn''t love the teel case, the bit of teal seemed so harshly shiny and that color just kept pulling my eye towards it rather than leaving me to peruse through the image.  I kept wondering if I would have liked the image more had the new phone been all clean white?</td>', 'Love the typewriter, and love the concept for the challenge.  I didn''t love the teel case, the bit of teal seemed so harshly shiny and that color just kept pulling my eye towards it rather than leaving me to peruse through the image.  I kept wondering if I would have liked the image more had the new phone been all clean white?', '2016-04-03 18:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
