(7451000, 1178022, 12611, '<td valign="top">the find and processing are both great. the composition is passable but could be even better, and by that, it might have been able to fix that with a crop, paying attention to the edges of the photo, or perhaps a subtle vignette. That might play nicely off the symmetry, or interesting lack there of in the center.<br/></td>', 'the find and processing are both great. the composition is passable but could be even better, and by that, it might have been able to fix that with a crop, paying attention to the edges of the photo, or perhaps a subtle vignette. That might play nicely off the symmetry, or interesting lack there of in the center.', '2016-04-19 10:04:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7452651, 1178271, 67258, '<td valign="top">OK, I have been absent from DPC for quite some while, but how on earth did this get the Brown?  It is absolutely spot on for the challenge, an interesting candid, a clever commentary on current social mores. Also, when did we only get 65 entries for a fairly mainstream challenge? Maybe I should start taking photos and entering again.<br/></td>', 'OK, I have been absent from DPC for quite some while, but how on earth did this get the Brown?  It is absolutely spot on for the challenge, an interesting candid, a clever commentary on current social mores. Also, when did we only get 65 entries for a fairly mainstream challenge? Maybe I should start taking photos and entering again.', '2016-04-29 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 0),
